        "Example: read basic rhythms and notes within a comfortable range.",
        "Example: sustain phrases with developing breath control.",
        "Required range, experience and any grade remain unconfirmed."
      ]
    },
    "seniorWind": {
      "summary": "Independent part reader",
      "details": [
        "Example: follow an individual orchestral part and count rests.",
        "Example: prepare more varied rhythms, keys and articulation.",
        "Instrument-specific range and doubling expectations need confirmation."
      ]
    },
    "juniorPercussion": {
      "summary": "Steady pulse & simple rhythms",
